r, play dress up with a powerful mix-and-match Wardrobe, and share your creations via Steam Workshop!","steam_appid":1361090,"support_info":{"email":"hello@trixelcreative.com","url":"https://www.trixelcreative.com/contact"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.trixelcreative.com/restitched"}